WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.547 --> 00:00:22.483
&gt;&gt; Leslie: this is our "inGraham

00:00:22.484 --> 00:00:23.551
angle" special town hall,

00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:26.353
Chicago, a city in crisis.

00:00:26.354 --> 00:00:29.523
we have the airways consumed,

00:00:29.524 --> 00:00:31.325
it's easy to forget the crisis

00:00:31.326 --> 00:00:33.194
unfolding on America's streets

00:00:33.195 --> 00:00:35.830
and the process being ignored as

00:00:35.831 --> 00:00:39.033
we retreat in our political

00:00:39.034 --> 00:00:39.733
corners.

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:41.435
we were here in Chicago a year

00:00:41.436 --> 00:00:41.735
ago.

00:00:41.736 --> 00:00:43.270
at that time we promised the

00:00:43.271 --> 00:00:45.105
&gt;&gt; Sean: PEOPLE IN THE

00:00:45.106 --> 00:00:46.207
COMMUNITIES AND OUR OFFICE IN

00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:47.675
GENERAL THAT WE'D BE BACK AND

00:00:47.676 --> 00:00:48.909
NOT LET THE ISSUES GO.

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:51.111
AND TONIGHT, WE'RE HERE TO

00:00:51.112 --> 00:00:51.712
FULFILL THAT PROMISE.

00:00:51.713 --> 00:00:53.514
WE RETURNED TO ASSESS HOW LIFE

00:00:53.515 --> 00:00:55.950
IS CHANGED OR NOT FOR THE

00:00:55.951 --> 00:00:57.251
VIOLENCE PLAGUED NEIGHBORHOODS.

00:00:57.252 --> 00:00:58.385
AND WHETHER THE RELATIONSHIP

00:00:58.386 --> 00:01:00.187
BETWEEN THE COMMUNITIES AND LAW

00:01:00.188 --> 00:01:06.260
ENFORCEMENT, WHETHER IT'S

00:01:06.261 --> 00:01:07.494
IMPROVED OR WORSENED THE CITY

00:01:07.495 --> 00:01:09.330
WAS BRUTALIZED BY GUN VIOLENCE

00:01:09.331 --> 00:01:11.131
AND BLOODSHED AND WHAT ARE

00:01:11.132 --> 00:01:14.835
POLITICAL LEADERS DOING ABOUT

00:01:14.836 --> 00:01:15.135
IT?

00:01:15.136 --> 00:01:18.072
LAST YEAR, RAHME EMMANUEL WAS

00:01:18.073 --> 00:01:19.874
FINISHING HIS FINAL YEAR AS

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:22.610
MAYOR AND NOW MAYOR LORIE

00:01:22.611 --> 00:01:24.778
LIGHTFOOT IS FACING A NUMBER OF

00:01:24.779 --> 00:01:26.914
CHALLENGES, A LOOMING TEACHER

00:01:26.915 --> 00:01:28.315
STRIKE, UNACCEPTABLE LEVEL OF

00:01:28.316 --> 00:01:29.650
GANG AND DRUG VIOLENCE, AND A

00:01:29.651 --> 00:01:31.585
CITY RUNNING OUT OF PATIENCE.

00:01:31.586 --> 00:01:33.220
WE'LL EXPLORE ALL OF IT WITH OUR

00:01:33.221 --> 00:01:36.156
LIVE AUDIENCE AND EXPERT PANELS.

00:01:36.157 --> 00:01:37.291
BUT I WANT YOU TO UNDERSTAND

00:01:37.292 --> 00:01:38.592
WHAT'S HAPPENING IN THE AREA WE

00:01:38.593 --> 00:01:40.394
ARE BROADCASTING FROM TONIGHT.

00:01:40.395 --> 00:01:43.530
WE'RE HERE AT NEW BEGINNINGS

00:01:43.531 --> 00:01:45.432
CHURCH AND IT'S SITUATED IN ONE

00:01:45.433 --> 00:01:47.067
OF THE MOST DANGEROUS

00:01:47.068 --> 00:01:48.335
NEIGHBORHOODS ON CHICAGO'S SOUTH

00:01:48.336 --> 00:01:48.636
SIDE.

00:01:48.637 --> 00:01:50.571
DO YOU SEE THE RED CIRCLES ON

00:01:50.572 --> 00:01:53.073
THAT MAP?

00:01:53.074 --> 00:01:54.775
WELL, THOSE ARE THE HOMICIDES

00:01:54.776 --> 00:01:56.810
THAT HAVE OCCURRED JUST THIS

00:01:56.811 --> 00:01:57.611
YEAR ALONE.

00:01:57.612 --> 00:01:58.946
AND CHILDREN ARE TOO OFTEN THE

00:01:58.947 --> 00:02:01.215
VICTIMS OF THE VIOLENCE HERE IN

00:02:01.216 --> 00:02:03.250
CHICAGO AS OUR OWN RAYMOND

00:02:03.251 --> 00:02:04.084
ARROYO FOUND ON THE SOUTH SIDE

00:02:04.085 --> 00:02:09.223
OF TOWN.

00:02:09.224 --> 00:02:12.259
&gt;&gt; WE'RE A FEW MILES FROM

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:14.895
TONIGHT'S TOWN HALL IN HARVEY.

00:02:14.896 --> 00:02:17.498
NOW, THE VIOLENCE IS INTENSE AND

00:02:17.499 --> 00:02:18.933
TO GIVE YOU A SENSE OF HOW

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:20.567
INTENSE THE VIOLENCE IS, IN THE

00:02:20.568 --> 00:02:23.837
CITY OF CHICAGO, THERE HAVE BEEN

00:02:23.838 --> 00:02:25.973
300 HOMICIDE PLUS JUST THIS

00:02:25.974 --> 00:02:26.273
YEAR.

00:02:26.274 --> 00:02:28.108
OVER 1600 SHOOTINGS, AND TO

00:02:28.109 --> 00:02:30.044
BRING IT HOME FOR PEOPLE IN THIS

00:02:30.045 --> 00:02:33.414
COMMUNITY, THE HOUSE BEHIND ME

00:02:33.415 --> 00:02:37.051
BELONGS TO KENTVANIA, SHE'S 12

00:02:37.052 --> 00:02:37.918
YEARS OLD.

00:02:37.919 --> 00:02:39.053
EARLIER THIS WEEK, SHE WAS

00:02:39.054 --> 00:02:40.587
MAKING PLANS FOR HER BIRTHDAY

00:02:40.588 --> 00:02:40.888
PARTY.

00:02:40.889 --> 00:02:43.223
HER FAMILY WAS WATCHING THE

00:02:43.224 --> 00:02:44.892
BEAR'S GAME, WHEN AROUND 9:00 AT

00:02:44.893 --> 00:02:46.260
NIGHT, A GROUP OF MEN APPROACHED

00:02:46.261 --> 00:02:49.863
THE HOUSE AND BULLETS STARTED

00:02:49.864 --> 00:02:51.332
FLYING, HER FAMILY HIT THE DECK

00:02:51.333 --> 00:02:53.534
AND SHE DIDN'T GET UP.

00:02:53.535 --> 00:02:55.135
A BULLET PIERCED THE FRONT

00:02:55.136 --> 00:02:56.236
WINDOW AND STRUCK HER IN THE

00:02:56.237 --> 00:02:56.870
BACK OF THE HEAD.

00:02:56.871 --> 00:03:04.044
SHE DIED ON HER BIRTHDAY.

00:03:04.045 --> 00:03:06.313
THE COMMUNITY IS STILL SHAKEN.

00:03:06.314 --> 00:03:07.281
&gt;&gt; WE HEARD IT.

00:03:07.282 --> 00:03:08.716
MY DAUGHTER WAS IN THE BACK OF

00:03:08.717 --> 00:03:09.283
THE HOUSE.

00:03:09.284 --> 00:03:10.617
TOLD HER TO GET DOWN.

00:03:10.618 --> 00:03:14.054
AND I CAME OUT AFTER THEY WERE

00:03:14.055 --> 00:03:17.091
OUT AND THEY WERE CRYING AND

00:03:17.092 --> 00:03:18.459
STUFF AND SINGING AND HOLLERING,

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.860
THAT COULD HAPPEN TO US.

00:03:19.861 --> 00:03:22.129
JUST RANDOM SHOOTING.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.331
&gt;&gt; EVERYONE JUST -- I HEAR

00:03:24.332 --> 00:03:26.433
THEY'RE NOT SLEEPING WELL.

00:03:26.434 --> 00:03:27.568
IT'S JUST BAD.

00:03:27.569 --> 00:03:30.104
&gt;&gt; SHOULDN'T HAVE TO ACTUALLY

00:03:30.105 --> 00:03:32.172
SEE THIS TYPE OF VIOLENCE, EVER.

00:03:32.173 --> 00:03:33.574
PRETTY MUCH ALL QUESTION DO IS

00:03:33.575 --> 00:03:35.242
JUST PRAY.

00:03:35.243 --> 00:03:37.311
&gt;&gt; I'VE BEEN HERE ALL MY LIFE.

00:03:37.312 --> 00:03:39.346
IT'S JUST NOT LIKE IT USED TO BE

00:03:39.347 --> 00:03:41.515
WHERE I GREW UP.

00:03:41.516 --> 00:03:42.716
&gt;&gt; DO YOU BRING THE KIDS IN

00:03:42.717 --> 00:03:43.250
EARLY ENOUGH?

00:03:43.251 --> 00:03:44.385
&gt;&gt; OH, YEAH.

00:03:44.386 --> 00:03:45.219
THEY STAY RIGHT HERE.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:45.953
NOWHERE ELSE.

00:03:45.954 --> 00:03:48.889
&gt;&gt; WHO DO YOU BLAME FOR THIS?

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.190
&gt;&gt; POLICE PRESENCE, RIDING

00:03:50.191 --> 00:03:51.992
AROUND, SEEING WHAT'S GOING ON

00:03:51.993 --> 00:03:52.626
IN THE COMMUNITY.

00:03:52.627 --> 00:03:54.094
GET OUT, MEET THE PEOPLE.

00:03:54.095 --> 00:03:55.496
&gt;&gt; IT'S AFFECTING EVERYONE AT

00:03:55.497 --> 00:03:56.230
THEIR CORE HERE.

00:03:56.231 --> 00:03:57.798
THERE'S NOT A SINGLE THING OF

00:03:57.799 --> 00:03:59.333
GUNS, YOU KNOW, GUN RIGHTS,

00:03:59.334 --> 00:03:59.733
WHATEVER.

00:03:59.734 --> 00:04:01.035
IT'S NOT JUST A SINGLE THING OF

00:04:01.036 --> 00:04:01.602
JUST THAT.

00:04:01.603 --> 00:04:06.106
IT'S A -- IT'S A GAMBIT OF

00:04:06.107 --> 00:04:07.307
THING, A LOT OF THINGS THAT COME

00:04:07.308 --> 00:04:08.375
IN THIS POT.

00:04:08.376 --> 00:04:10.811
&gt;&gt; I'VE BEEN HERE 50 SOME YEARS.

00:04:10.812 --> 00:04:11.812
I RAISED MY KIDS HERE.

00:04:11.813 --> 00:04:16.784
I AM SCARED.

00:04:16.785 --> 00:04:17.718
&gt;&gt; SO FAR THIS YEAR, HOMICIDE

00:04:17.719 --> 00:04:19.553
ARE TRACKING AT A SLOWER PACE

00:04:19.554 --> 00:04:20.988
THAN THEY WERE IN 2018.

00:04:20.989 --> 00:04:22.689
BUT THEY'RE STILL NEAR THE TOP

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.692
FOR AN AMERICAN CITY, LAST YEAR,

00:04:25.693 --> 00:04:27.294
EXCEEDING THE MURDER RATES ABOVE

00:04:27.295 --> 00:04:28.328
NEW YORK AND L.A.

00:04:28.329 --> 00:04:29.897
BUT FOR THE PEOPLE IN THESE

00:04:29.898 --> 00:04:31.799
AT-RISK COMMUNITIES, THE

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:32.666
STATISTIC, THEY DON'T MEAN ALL

00:04:32.667 --> 00:04:33.400
THAT MUCH.

00:04:33.401 --> 00:04:34.568
THEY'RE SUFFERING FROM

00:04:34.569 --> 00:04:35.402
UNACCEPTABLE LEVELS OF ROUTINE

00:04:35.403 --> 00:04:39.973
VIOLENCE.

00:04:39.974 --> 00:04:42.109
JOINING ME NOW IS TONY ROBINSON,

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.444
FORMER CHICAGO POLICE OFFICER IN

00:04:43.445 --> 00:04:45.279
THE VIOLENT CRIMES DIVISION,

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.814
FORMER HOMICIDE DETECTIVE,

00:04:46.815 --> 00:04:49.316
JOSEPH MOSELEY, AND A FORMER

00:04:49.317 --> 00:04:51.118
HOMICIDE DETECTIVE AND 30-YEAR

00:04:51.119 --> 00:04:52.386
VETERAN OF THE CHICAGO POLICE

00:04:52.387 --> 00:04:53.520
DEPARTMENT, AND ANTHONY

00:04:53.521 --> 00:04:55.155
WILLIAMS, PASTOR AND ACTIVIST

00:04:55.156 --> 00:05:00.961
HERE IN CHICAGO.

00:05:00.962 --> 00:05:02.262
TONY, I WANT TO START WITH YOU.

00:05:02.263 --> 00:05:08.335
IT'S HARD TO WATCH THAT STORY.

00:05:08.336 --> 00:05:09.169
THE FACTS.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:10.671
THE PROMISE OF A YOUNG GIRL CUT

00:05:10.672 --> 00:05:15.742
SHORT NEEDLESSLY.

00:05:15.743 --> 00:05:17.478
SHE'S, ONE, THOUGH, OF HUNDREDS

00:05:17.479 --> 00:05:24.618
UPON HUNDREDS OF AFTERRY  --

00:05:24.619 --> 00:05:25.385
AFRICAN-AMERICAN YOUTH THAT GET

00:05:25.386 --> 00:05:27.154
CAUGHT UP IN THIS TYPE OF

00:05:27.155 --> 00:05:27.521
VIOLENCE.

00:05:27.522 --> 00:05:28.455
PEOPLE WATCHING TONIGHT SAY WHAT

00:05:28.456 --> 00:05:29.490
DO WE DO?

00:05:29.491 --> 00:05:30.958
HOW DO WE STOP THIS?

00:05:30.959 --> 00:05:32.292
&gt;&gt; WE CANNOT POLICE OUR WAY OUT

00:05:32.293 --> 00:05:32.726
OF THIS.

00:05:32.727 --> 00:05:34.428
THIS HAS TO COME FROM THE

00:05:34.429 --> 00:05:34.795
COMMUNITY.

00:05:34.796 --> 00:05:35.829
AND BEING A HOMICIDE DETECTIVE,

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.831
IT HURTS ME JUST AS MUCH WHEN I

00:05:37.832 --> 00:05:38.999
CAN'T SOLVE THAT PROBLEM.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.634
WHEN I CANNOT GET MEMBERS OF THE

00:05:40.635 --> 00:05:42.102
COMMUNITY, WHO KNOWS?

00:05:42.103 --> 00:05:43.036
AND I UNDERSTAND IT, BECAUSE

00:05:43.037 --> 00:05:46.573
THEY HAVE TO LIVE THERE.

00:05:46.574 --> 00:05:48.208
THEY DON'T WANT TO TALK TO THE

00:05:48.209 --> 00:05:48.542
POLICE.

00:05:48.543 --> 00:05:49.576
WE NEED TO BACK OUR PROGRAMS

00:05:49.577 --> 00:05:51.278
THAT WE USED TO HAVE ON THE

00:05:51.279 --> 00:05:53.647
POLICE DEPARTMENT LIKE OFFICER

00:05:53.648 --> 00:05:54.014
FRIENDLY.

00:05:54.015 --> 00:05:56.550
THE EXPLORER SCOUTS, TAKE THE

00:05:56.551 --> 00:05:57.251
YOUTH, GIVE THEM SOMETHING TO

00:05:57.252 --> 00:06:01.922
DO.

00:06:01.923 --> 00:06:03.657
WE HAVE TO REALLY BE INVOLVED

00:06:03.658 --> 00:06:04.958
WITH OUR COMMUNITY AND OUR

00:06:04.959 --> 00:06:05.292
YOUTH.

00:06:05.293 --> 00:06:07.561
WHEN I WORKED THERE FOR 29

00:06:07.562 --> 00:06:08.428
YEARS, EVERYBODY THAT KNEW ME

00:06:08.429 --> 00:06:12.799
KNEW I WAS A GOOD COP.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.201
AND I WORKED MY BUTT OFF.

00:06:14.202 --> 00:06:16.336
I CONTINUE TO VOLUNTEER, GO TO

00:06:16.337 --> 00:06:18.672
THE ACADEMY, TALK TO OUR YOUNG

00:06:18.673 --> 00:06:19.239
RECRUITS.

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:20.440
POLICING IS A STATE OF MIND, NOT

00:06:20.441 --> 00:06:23.443
A STATE OF BEING.

00:06:23.444 --> 00:06:25.779
YOU CAN'T JUST PUT SOMEONE OFF

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.948
OF THE STREET AND SAY YOU EAR

00:06:27.949 --> 00:06:28.382
THE POLICE.

00:06:28.383 --> 00:06:31.885
THEY COMPLAIN ABOUT TRAINING.

00:06:31.886 --> 00:06:34.788
YOU KNOW SOMETHING?

00:06:34.789 --> 00:06:40.861
DO WHAT YOU WERE TRAINED TO DO.

00:06:40.862 --> 00:06:44.097
TREAT PEOPLE WITH EMPATHY.

00:06:44.098 --> 00:06:44.731
BE FAIR.

00:06:44.732 --> 00:06:46.733
AND UNDERSTAND THAT JUST BECAUSE

00:06:46.734 --> 00:06:49.102
SOMEONE LIVES IN A PROJECT OR A

00:06:49.103 --> 00:06:49.870
TORN-DOWN NEIGHBORHOOD, THEY

00:06:49.871 --> 00:06:51.004
DON'T HAVE THAT MENTALITY.

00:06:51.005 --> 00:06:53.340
AND IT'S JUST A VERY FEW PEOPLE

00:06:53.341 --> 00:06:55.175
THAT'S IN OUR COMMUNITY THAT

00:06:55.176 --> 00:06:56.577
RAISES ALL OF THIS CONFUSION.

00:06:56.578 --> 00:07:00.280
&gt;&gt; WE'RE GOING TO GET BACK TO

00:07:00.281 --> 00:07:02.349
YOUR SON WHO IS NOW A NEW POLICE

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:02.716
OFFICER.

00:07:02.717 --> 00:07:03.317
&gt;&gt; GOD BLESS HIM.

00:07:03.318 --> 00:07:04.451
&gt;&gt; IN CHICAGO.

00:07:04.452 --> 00:07:05.519
YOU DIDN'T EVEN KNOW HE WAS

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.521
APPLYING FOR THE ACADEMY?

00:07:07.522 --> 00:07:08.455
&gt;&gt; I HAD NO IDEA.

00:07:08.456 --> 00:07:08.989
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:16.330
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:07:16.331 --> 00:07:17.831
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO GO TO YOU.

00:07:17.832 --> 00:07:19.900
YOU'RE AN ACTIVIST.

00:07:19.901 --> 00:07:21.935
YOU'VE BEEN ENGAGED HERE AS A

00:07:21.936 --> 00:07:23.303
COMMUNITY ACTIVIST FOR YEARS AND

00:07:23.304 --> 00:07:23.604
YEARS.

00:07:23.605 --> 00:07:26.607
PEOPLE SAY, WELL, IT'S GETTING

00:07:26.608 --> 00:07:27.608
BETTER, BE PATIENT.

00:07:27.609 --> 00:07:29.409
IT'S OKAY, IT'S GETTING BETTER,

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:30.477
IT'S TRENDING BETTER.

00:07:30.478 --> 00:07:34.514
DO YOU FEEL  THAT?

00:07:34.515 --> 00:07:35.782
AND DO YOU UNDERSTAND WHAT TONY

00:07:35.783 --> 00:07:37.150
SAID, IT'S NOT A POLICING

00:07:37.151 --> 00:07:38.785
PROBLEM, IT'S A COMMUNITY

00:07:38.786 --> 00:07:39.152
PROBLEM.

00:07:39.153 --> 00:07:41.154
&gt;&gt; I LOST A SON TO VIOLENCE

00:07:41.155 --> 00:07:43.657
FEBRUARY 21, 2018, JEREMIAH

00:07:43.658 --> 00:07:44.224
WILLIAMS.

00:07:44.225 --> 00:07:45.559
VIOLENCE IS THE NUMBER ONE

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.995
PROBLEM OF THE 21st CENTURY.

00:07:47.996 --> 00:07:50.464
WHAT WE DID -- OUR RESPONSE WAS

00:07:50.465 --> 00:07:53.000
TO TALK WITH OUR STATE

00:07:53.001 --> 00:07:54.468
REPRESENTATIVES FOR NINE DAYS.

00:07:54.469 --> 00:07:58.238
WE HAD A RESOLUTION PASSED.

00:07:58.239 --> 00:08:01.942
VIOLENCE IS A HEALTH CRISES,

00:08:01.943 --> 00:08:03.844
WE'RE PREPARING TO WALK TO

00:08:03.845 --> 00:08:05.078
SPRINGFIELD ON OCTOBER 14.

00:08:05.079 --> 00:08:07.281
THE GOAL IS TO PASS

00:08:07.282 --> 00:08:08.582
COMPREHENSIVE LEGISLATION ON

00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:13.253
VIOLENCE AS A HELP CRISES AND A

00:08:13.254 --> 00:08:13.820
DISEASE.

00:08:13.821 --> 00:08:15.455
THE SYSTEM OF VIOLENCE IS

00:08:15.456 --> 00:08:15.889
OVERWHELMING.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:19.293
WE ALL AS CITIZENS MUST DEAL

00:08:19.294 --> 00:08:21.695
WITH THIS LEVIATHAN, THE ISSUE

00:08:21.696 --> 00:08:23.730
OF VIOLENCE IS EVERYONE'S FIGHT.

00:08:23.731 --> 00:08:26.333
HISTORY SHOWS US THAT IN

00:08:26.334 --> 00:08:29.102
AMERICA, YOU WANT TO COME AT

00:08:29.103 --> 00:08:31.638
JUSTICE ON EVIL LEGISLATION.

00:08:31.639 --> 00:08:33.507
WE CAN'T LEGISLATE OURSELVES OUT

00:08:33.508 --> 00:08:35.676
OF THIS, POLICE OURSELVES OUT OF

00:08:35.677 --> 00:08:37.244
THIS, BUT WE NEED CIVILITY RIGHT

00:08:37.245 --> 00:08:37.711
NOW.

00:08:37.712 --> 00:08:39.279
CIVILITY IS IMPORTANT.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:40.814
VIOLENCE AIN'T COOL.

00:08:40.815 --> 00:08:42.616
CIVILITY IS -- IS POWERFUL.

00:08:42.617 --> 00:08:44.785
THIS IS THE HUMAN HEALTH CRISES.

00:08:44.786 --> 00:08:46.553
NO ONE IS SAFE NO MATTER WHERE

00:08:46.554 --> 00:08:47.621
YOU LIVE.

00:08:47.622 --> 00:08:50.157
SO, WE ARE WORKING TOWARDS

00:08:50.158 --> 00:08:50.924
COMPREHENSIVE LEGISLATION.

00:08:50.925 --> 00:08:52.859
&gt;&gt; INVOLVING WHAT?

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:54.594
&gt;&gt; COMPREHENSIVE LEGISLATION

00:08:54.595 --> 00:08:55.495
WILL BE UNDER HEALTH CARE.

00:08:55.496 --> 00:08:57.397
THE CDC HAS SAID THAT VIOLENCE

00:08:57.398 --> 00:08:57.998
IS A DISEASE.

00:08:57.999 --> 00:09:00.500
BUT IT'S NOT A CONTAGIOUS.

00:09:00.501 --> 00:09:02.069
WE DO NOT NEED VACCINES.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:04.971
BUT WE NEED COMPREHENSIVE

00:09:04.972 --> 00:09:05.372
LEGISLATION.

00:09:05.373 --> 00:09:07.274
SAME THING LIKE CIGARETTES, IT'S

00:09:07.275 --> 00:09:08.342
ALMOST UN-AMERICAN NOT TO SMOKE

00:09:08.343 --> 00:09:10.777
AT A BAR BUT YOU CAN'T SMOKE IN

00:09:10.778 --> 00:09:11.578
A BAR ANYMORE, WHY?

00:09:11.579 --> 00:09:12.979
BECAUSE IT'S THE LAW.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:14.881
IT'S THE LAW THAT MOVES THE

00:09:14.882 --> 00:09:15.215
NEEDLE.

